- Tax is rounded *up* to the minor unit. That is what tax authorities require, and what naive
- rounding gets wrong in exactly the cases which matter. Twenty per cent of £2.94 is £0.588,
- which is charged as £0.59:
+ Steuer wird auf die Untereinheit *auf*gerundet. Das verlangen Steuerbehörden, und genau in den
+ Fällen, auf die es ankommt, macht naives Runden es falsch. Zwanzig Prozent von 2,94 £ sind
+ 0,588 £, die als 0,59 £ berechnet werden:

= which is charged as £0.59:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= which is charged as £0.59:
=
= ```scala fuel
- run
+ run

= which is charged as £0.59:
=
= ```scala fuel
= run
