- ### Identifiers
+ ### Bezeichner

- The identifying numbers of finance are checked here too. An
- [ISIN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Securities_Identification_Number) is the
- international identifier of a security. The `isin"…"` [interpolator] validates one at
- [compiletime], including its checksum, and `Isin(…)` does the same at runtime:
+ Auch die Identifikationsnummern der Finanzwelt werden hier geprüft. Eine
+ [ISIN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Securities_Identification_Number) ist der
+ internationale Bezeichner eines Wertpapiers. Der [Interpolator] `isin"…"` validiert eine zur
+ [Kompilierzeit], einschließlich ihrer Prüfsumme, und `Isin(…)` tut dasselbe zur Laufzeit:

= [compiletime], including its checksum, and `Isin(…)` does the same at runtime:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"
+ val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"

= val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"
- ```
+ ```

